{"title":"Career Roadmap: Business Development Associate","role":"Business Development Associate","summary":"A Business Development Associate (BDA) helps an organization identify growth opportunities and convert them into customers, partnerships, revenue or strategic relationships.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com - Entrepreneurship / Startups"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build skills in market research, lead generation, sales, partnerships, customer acquisition and startup growth"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Business Development Associate (BDA) helps an organization identify growth opportunities and convert them into customers, partnerships, revenue or strategic relationships."},{"type":"p","text":"In a startup, the role can be broad and may involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Lead generation"},{"text":"Prospecting"},{"text":"Cold outreach"},{"text":"Customer qualification"},{"text":"Sales calls and demonstrations"},{"text":"Proposal preparation"},{"text":"Negotiation support"},{"text":"Partnership development"},{"text":"CRM management"},{"text":"Customer onboarding"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Revenue and pipeline reporting"},{"text":"Founder/management support for growth initiatives"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com Entrepreneurship/Startups graduate, the strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commerce","Sales","Marketing","Entrepreneurship","Business Analytics","CRM","Communication"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business fundamentals"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, management, marketing"},{"text":"Small market-research project"},{"text":"Only theor